  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You receive the same merciful measure you dole out to your allies.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Reward of Life<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use your lay on hands ability to heal another creature, you heal a number of hit points equal to your mythic tier plus your Charisma modifier. In addition, you may apply the effects of any one mercy you possess to yourself, or you may choose to heal 1 point of ability damage you have taken.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc31\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
